07398, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 317770839, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "🏆 Keeps · the top N of N + 5", "originalText": "🏆 Keeps · the top N of N + 5", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-21e9a669b5d4", "type": "arrow", "x": 3770.0, "y": 8883.75, "width": 32.5, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-0bb3b2e56d55", "roundness": null, "seed": 828811629, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1036685310, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0.0, 0.0], [32.5, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false, "containerId": null}, {"id": "kept_s-84a494216ba5", "type": "text", "x": 1830.0, "y": 9061.25, "width": 934.4, "height": 20.3125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-0bb3b2e56d55", "roundness": null, "seed": 711698653, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 885064989, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Reads the raw data with code, keeps its analysis, then proposes ideas from its own findings.", "originalText": "Reads the raw data with code, keeps its analysis, then proposes ideas from its own findings.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-d00d302b176c", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1475.0, "y": 9120.0, "width": 2795.0, "height": 187.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-0bb3b2e56d55", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 33125958, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 860514094, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null}, {"id": "kept_s-2a89ab97878d", "type": "text", "x": 1497.5, "y": 9137.5, "width": 191.95, "height": 26.5625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-0bb3b2e56d55", "roundness": null, "seed": 682261481, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 526243733, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "How to read it", "originalText": "How to read it", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-b1cfff2e7a17", "type": "text", "x": 1497.5, "y": 9175.0, "width": 2199.2, "height": 109.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-0bb3b2e56d55", "roundness": null, "seed": 39817590, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 559879850, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "· ① is the content we give; the brain, the model's own knowledge, is always there and fixed by the model snapshot; ② is where they meet, and each idea names its source(s)\n· ③ and ④ run once per idea (the dashed frame): the input + one idea → one design → its own check\n· ⑤ ranks every design together; with N + 5 ideas it keeps the best N · a chip names its part first\n· an analysis has a form (numbers · a report · DIKW) and a maker: given, made before and checked, or made inside the unit by the agent itself or by the Insight agent it calls (unsigned, frozen before ②)\n· M01-M04 share the planner, the process and the checks and differ in ① and so in the analysis ② may draw on; the brain is the same for all · M05 makes its own analysis", "originalText": "· ① is the content we give; the brain, the model's own knowledge, is always there and fixed by the model snapshot; ② is where they meet, and each idea names its source(s)\n· ③ and ④ run once per idea (the dashed frame): the input + one idea → one design → its own check\n· ⑤ ranks every design together; with N + 5 ideas it keeps the best N · a chip names its part first\n· an analysis has a form (numbers · a report · DIKW) and a maker: given, made before and checked, or made inside the unit by the agent itself or by the Insight agent it calls (unsigned, frozen before ②)\n· M01-M04 share the planner, the process and the checks and differ in ① and so in the analysis ② may draw on; the brain is the same for all · M05 makes its own analysis", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "room3", "type": "text", "x": 1400, "y": 9462.5, "width": 327.36, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 416565834, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 736200017, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "your room: write, draw, mark here", "originalText": "your room: write, draw, mark here", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 8, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"